1
00:00:01,542 --> 00:00:04,937
The Secret is Out!

2
00:00:10,624 --> 00:00:13,816
Hey, Dad! Do you know what day it is tomorrow?

3
00:00:13,816 --> 00:00:16,495
Tell me, what day is it tomorrow? 🎵

4
00:00:16,577 --> 00:00:18,704
Did you forget? I'll give you a hint, it's-

5
00:00:18,704 --> 00:00:21,268
Is it our son's turn to do the chores?

6
00:00:21,268 --> 00:00:23,288
No, no, it's something more special than-

7
00:00:23,288 --> 00:00:24,957
Is it time for spring cleaning?

8
00:00:24,957 --> 00:00:27,428
Your room is getting pretty messy after all.

9
00:00:27,428 --> 00:00:31,300
I would appreciate it if you could clean the garage and mow the lawn while you're at it. Eh?

10
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,539
Ugh... Tch.

11
00:00:43,594 --> 00:00:45,115
Vera!

12
00:00:45,716 --> 00:00:47,295
What are you looking at?

13
00:00:47,295 --> 00:00:48,402
Jun!

14
00:00:48,402 --> 00:00:50,262
Huh?! Jun?

15
00:00:50,262 --> 00:00:51,722
Wait, Vera... do you have a crush on...

16
00:00:51,722 --> 00:00:53,082
No!

17
00:00:53,082 --> 00:00:56,000
I'm just keeping an eye on him. I'm going to find out his secret!

18
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,326
Secret?

19
00:00:57,326 --> 00:01:01,551
Yes! It's something so top secret that even FBI agents would be rushing after him!

20
00:01:01,551 --> 00:01:02,621
You'd better watch out!

21
00:01:04,876 --> 00:01:06,736
Top secret...?

22
00:01:07,516 --> 00:01:09,620
Metal Breath, pickup...

23
00:01:18,097 --> 00:01:20,222
Mega Trucker, setup...

24
00:01:37,347 --> 00:01:39,228
Now, come at me!

25
00:01:50,334 --> 00:01:51,688
That was good!

26
00:01:51,688 --> 00:01:55,134
With a few tweaks here and there, I think I can make your shield even stronger.

27
00:01:56,206 --> 00:01:59,218
Huh, really? Then let's do it right now!

28
00:01:59,218 --> 00:02:04,156
It's not that easy. The stronger the shield, the more energy it's gonna consume, you know?

29
00:02:04,156 --> 00:02:06,730
What if it stops working when you need it the most?

30
00:02:07,230 --> 00:02:09,298
Come back, Mega Trucker!

31
00:02:12,828 --> 00:02:15,060
I'll be off now, Uncle Edo...

32
00:02:15,060 --> 00:02:17,239
What? Leaving so soon?

33
00:02:17,239 --> 00:02:20,920
It's my turn to do the chores, ahaha...

34
00:02:23,021 --> 00:02:25,538
What's got him acting so strange?

35
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:31,919
A secret? Jun's keeping one?

36
00:02:31,919 --> 00:02:34,087
Mhm. Do you know anything?

37
00:02:34,087 --> 00:02:36,122
Oh, uh...

38
00:02:38,573 --> 00:02:39,651
Attack!

39
00:02:44,115 --> 00:02:44,877
Punch!

40
00:02:45,316 --> 00:02:46,973
You got this, Blue Cop!

41
00:02:47,740 --> 00:02:48,894
Sealing complete!

42
00:02:48,894 --> 00:02:51,550
It's not like he doesn't have any secrets, but...

43
00:02:51,550 --> 00:02:53,694
What is it, Theo?! Tell me!

44
00:02:53,694 --> 00:02:55,221
A-actually...

45
00:02:55,221 --> 00:02:56,287
Actually?

46
00:02:56,287 --> 00:02:57,734
Well, Jun is...

47
00:02:57,734 --> 00:02:58,870
Yeah?

48
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:00,829
It's his birthday today!

49
00:03:00,829 --> 00:03:03,294
Oh-aha! That was it?

50
00:03:03,294 --> 00:03:05,568
Y-Yeah, that's it.

51
00:03:05,568 --> 00:03:09,884
Oh, Theo, you should have told me sooner! I was worried over nothing!

52
00:03:09,884 --> 00:03:11,925
In that case, we should go celebrate!

53
00:03:11,925 --> 00:03:13,348
Celebrate?

54
00:03:13,348 --> 00:03:17,566
Yes! We should get a cake and go to Jun's house right now!

55
00:03:17,566 --> 00:03:19,877
S-shouldn't we call him and let him know we're coming?

56
00:03:19,877 --> 00:03:25,264
But that's no fun! I'm sure Jun would like a surprise party even more!

57
00:03:25,264 --> 00:03:28,655
Oh no, this can only end badly...

58
00:03:33,932 --> 00:03:38,468
It's my birthday, so why do I have to mow the lawn?!

59
00:03:38,468 --> 00:03:42,161
Both Mom and Dad aren't showing any love for their son today.

60
00:03:42,161 --> 00:03:43,920
Jun, whatcha doin'?

61
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:46,377
Can't you see? I'm mowing the lawn!

62
00:03:46,377 --> 00:03:49,218
It looks fun! Let me try, let me try!

63
00:03:49,218 --> 00:03:50,163
Wha...?

64
00:03:55,322 --> 00:03:57,120
Woohoo!

65
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,562
Having fun?

66
00:03:59,008 --> 00:04:01,080
Haha! This is the best!

67
00:04:03,036 --> 00:04:06,205
Hey, Jun! Give me something to do too.

68
00:04:12,223 --> 00:04:14,687
Haha! This is fun!

69
00:04:15,181 --> 00:04:17,971
I'm happy if you guys are happy.

70
00:04:18,247 --> 00:04:19,338
Jun.

71
00:04:19,831 --> 00:04:22,980
What if someone sees them? We agreed to keep the Metal Cardbots a secret.

72
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:25,644
That's right, but...

73
00:04:26,733 --> 00:04:31,139
Ah, Blue Cop! I have a job for you that'll keep everyone from being seen!

74
00:04:31,942 --> 00:04:33,766
Yeah man, wasn't the food today just the-

75
00:04:33,766 --> 00:04:34,792
Huh?

76
00:04:35,908 --> 00:04:39,278
This street is currently closed. Please find a detour.

77
00:04:39,379 --> 00:04:41,199
Let's just go to the internet cafe.

78
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:42,778
Yeah, let's go.

79
00:04:44,199 --> 00:04:46,379
Should we really be doing this?

80
00:04:46,379 --> 00:04:48,788
Relax. What's the worst that could happen?

81
00:04:51,689 --> 00:04:53,283
Excuse me!

82
00:04:53,610 --> 00:04:55,870
I'm sorry, but this area is off limits.

83
00:04:55,870 --> 00:04:56,543
Huh?

84
00:04:56,543 --> 00:04:59,374
Hi... I'm sorry, but we just need to cross the street.

85
00:04:59,374 --> 00:05:01,403
Could you let us through?

86
00:05:01,403 --> 00:05:04,845
But, uh... well, uh... What should I do?

87
00:05:04,845 --> 00:05:05,785
Um...

88
00:05:05,785 --> 00:05:07,598
Oh, it's you!

89
00:05:07,598 --> 00:05:11,031
Perhaps... you could go ask the person in charge?

90
00:05:11,031 --> 00:05:14,415
Oh, haha, right. Hold on a minute!

91
00:05:15,725 --> 00:05:17,699
Okay, let him through!

92
00:05:17,699 --> 00:05:18,769
What's up?

93
00:05:19,170 --> 00:05:20,637
Theo came to visit.

94
00:05:25,076 --> 00:05:26,185
Waah!

95
00:05:26,185 --> 00:05:27,980
Hello!

96
00:05:28,153 --> 00:05:30,163
H-Heyyy!

97
00:05:30,451 --> 00:05:32,413
It's an emergency! Hurry, hurry, transform!

98
00:05:32,413 --> 00:05:34,769
This is bad!

99
00:05:34,769 --> 00:05:37,387
Sorry for dropping in like this. Is now a bad time?

100
00:05:37,387 --> 00:05:41,439
Of course not! You guys are always welcome here!

101
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:43,759
I'm glad! What are you up to?

102
00:05:43,759 --> 00:05:46,218
Uh... Just some yard work?

103
00:05:46,218 --> 00:05:47,826
Wow! Can I see?

104
00:05:47,826 --> 00:05:53,362
B-b-b-but Anna! I-It's not done yet!

105
00:05:54,906 --> 00:05:56,658
Why is there a truck in your yard?

106
00:05:56,658 --> 00:05:59,699
Uh, someone just asked me to take care of it!

107
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:05,298
Aah! Hey! Wait!

108
00:06:06,598 --> 00:06:07,947
Why don't we-

109
00:06:11,074 --> 00:06:12,035
Aah!

110
00:06:12,035 --> 00:06:13,990
Shadow X, stealth mode on!

111
00:06:13,990 --> 00:06:16,345
Stop that. What are you doing?

112
00:06:17,446 --> 00:06:18,675
There was a huge bug!

113
00:06:18,675 --> 00:06:21,747
Theo, you really hate bugs, right? I know how you get!

114
00:06:23,947 --> 00:06:26,252
So Anna, what brings you here?

115
00:06:26,252 --> 00:06:27,699
Oh, that's right!

116
00:06:30,843 --> 00:06:33,507
There, you can open your eyes now.

117
00:06:35,944 --> 00:06:38,600
Happy birthday, Jun!

118
00:06:43,786 --> 00:06:49,552
Thank you, Anna! I never imagined you'd come to wish me a happy birthday!

119
00:06:49,552 --> 00:06:52,394
Now, it's time to blow out the candles!

120
00:06:54,406 --> 00:06:56,963
This is Blue Cop. Jun. Please respond.

121
00:06:58,639 --> 00:07:00,194
What was that noise?

122
00:07:00,194 --> 00:07:01,759
Right, that was..?

123
00:07:01,759 --> 00:07:04,588
I-It must be the TV in the living room!

124
00:07:05,189 --> 00:07:09,980
I think it's time we open the street back up. Would that be okay? Jun?

125
00:07:09,980 --> 00:07:11,129
Jun?

126
00:07:11,129 --> 00:07:12,437
I need a response!

127
00:07:12,437 --> 00:07:14,437
Jun! Jun! Jun!

128
00:07:14,437 --> 00:07:16,562
Ahaha! Theo, why do you keep calling my name?

129
00:07:16,562 --> 00:07:19,235
H-happy birthday, Jun!

130
00:07:19,783 --> 00:07:21,836
Jun! Why aren't you answering?

131
00:07:21,836 --> 00:07:23,968
What? What's the matter?

132
00:07:26,384 --> 00:07:29,401
Maybe he was taken hostage by robbers!

133
00:07:31,375 --> 00:07:33,463
Jun! I'm on my way!

134
00:07:34,773 --> 00:07:35,641
Blue Cop!

135
00:07:53,562 --> 00:07:54,901
What was that?

136
00:07:54,918 --> 00:07:56,778
It sounded like a car accident!

137
00:07:56,778 --> 00:07:58,810
Anyway, let's blow out the candles!

138
00:07:58,810 --> 00:08:01,024
Yes! Let's sing Happy Birthday now!

139
00:08:01,024 --> 00:08:02,956
1, 2, 3!

140
00:08:02,956 --> 00:08:07,297
Happy birthday to me...

141
00:08:17,987 --> 00:08:19,456
What's happening?!

142
00:08:24,064 --> 00:08:25,966
Now this looks really bad!

143
00:08:25,966 --> 00:08:28,620
Don't just stand there, go give them a hand!

144
00:08:28,620 --> 00:08:31,538
What do we do? Jun! Hurry, give us a command!

145
00:08:31,538 --> 00:08:32,750
Jun?!

146
00:08:35,652 --> 00:08:38,706
You're hiding something from me, aren't you?!

147
00:08:38,706 --> 00:08:40,807
But... I...

148
00:08:40,807 --> 00:08:42,120
That's it!

149
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,860
Ah, no! Anna!

150
00:08:52,340 --> 00:08:53,164
Hello.

151
00:08:54,495 --> 00:08:56,488
Aah!!

152
00:09:00,245 --> 00:09:01,427
She just found out.

153
00:09:01,427 --> 00:09:03,514
The secret is out...

154
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:09,000
So you guys are like...

155
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:14,807
refugees who came to Earth all the way from planet Machina at the other end of the galaxy?

156
00:09:14,807 --> 00:09:16,370
Oh...

157
00:09:16,370 --> 00:09:17,985
She's smart.

158
00:09:17,985 --> 00:09:21,725
So, Anna. You'll help us keep these guys a secret, right?

159
00:09:21,725 --> 00:09:23,062
I'm afraid I can't.

160
00:09:23,062 --> 00:09:24,855
Huh? Why not?

161
00:09:24,855 --> 00:09:28,500
Because, this is the first encounter between humanity and aliens.

162
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:31,451
This isn't something that kids should be handling.

163
00:09:31,451 --> 00:09:32,658
But I'm a grown-up.

164
00:09:32,658 --> 00:09:34,158
I'm sorry, Uncle Edo.

165
00:09:34,158 --> 00:09:36,730
Apologizing just makes it sound worse...

166
00:09:36,730 --> 00:09:39,956
Anna. We just want to live quietly on planet Earth.

167
00:09:39,956 --> 00:09:41,134
Please understand.

168
00:09:41,432 --> 00:09:45,235
It's not that I don't trust you. It's just that...

169
00:09:45,235 --> 00:09:48,697
I don't have it in me to keep lying to the grown ups.

170
00:09:51,378 --> 00:09:52,993
Hey, it's my dad!

171
00:09:53,293 --> 00:09:54,086
Dad?

172
00:09:54,086 --> 00:09:55,479
The father of this child.

173
00:09:55,479 --> 00:09:57,481
A human who has grown up.

174
00:09:57,481 --> 00:10:00,798
Among humans, Anna's father is pretty high-profile.

175
00:10:00,798 --> 00:10:02,644
He's the mayor of Mowtown!

176
00:10:02,644 --> 00:10:03,336
Shh!

177
00:10:05,782 --> 00:10:07,230
Hello?

178
00:10:08,082 --> 00:10:10,475
Anna, where are you right now?

179
00:10:11,115 --> 00:10:13,158
He's asking where I am!

180
00:10:13,158 --> 00:10:14,817
Why is he asking that?

181
00:10:14,817 --> 00:10:17,254
Could it be... that he found out about us?

182
00:10:17,254 --> 00:10:19,423
No, don't be ridiculous!

183
00:10:19,423 --> 00:10:22,182
He's not a mind reader. How could he know?

184
00:10:22,182 --> 00:10:25,787
No, no! My dad really knows everything!

185
00:10:25,787 --> 00:10:28,898
He knew right away when I skipped piano practice, and when I broke a vase!

186
00:10:28,898 --> 00:10:31,394
Yeah! Grown-ups know everything.

187
00:10:31,394 --> 00:10:34,350
That's right. Lies won't work on them.

188
00:10:34,350 --> 00:10:37,797
Hang on! You mean, the mayor already knows?

189
00:10:38,653 --> 00:10:41,182
About the existence of Metal Cardbots on Earth?

